From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Fluorite Integration Role
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 20:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] filament_view: register default light before its component

The default-light path creates an ECS component immediately after creating
its owning entity.  ECSManager requires the entity to be registered first;
otherwise an empty scene aborts with checkHasEntity during startup.

---
 .../core/systems/derived/light_system.cc              | 3 ++-
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/systems/derived/light_system.cc b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/systems/derived/light_system.cc
--- a/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/systems/derived/light_system.cc
+++ b/ivi-homescreen-plugins/plugins/filament_view/core/systems/derived/light_system.cc
@@ -42,0 +43 @@ void LightSystem::vCreateDefaultLight() {
+  ecs->addEntity(m_poDefaultLight);
@@ -55 +55,0 @@ void LightSystem::vCreateDefaultLight() {
-  ecs->addEntity(m_poDefaultLight);
--
2.34.1
